    <summary>IPMIView is a GUI application that allows administration of multiple Supermicro servers over IPMI (KVM, SOL, sensors, power, FRU).</summary>
    <description>IPMIView is a management software application that allows the administration of multiple Supermicro servers through their Baseboard Management Controllers (BMC) over IPMI.

Features include:
- Discovery and grouping of IPMI-enabled Supermicro systems
- Remote KVM (console redirection) and Serial-over-LAN (SOL)
- Sensor monitoring, System Event Log (SEL) viewing
- Power control and virtual media
- FRU information and user management

IPMIView is a Java application and is distributed with its own bundled runtime.

![IPMIView](https://rawcdn.githack.com/EpicMorg/chocolatey/refs/heads/develop/.github/ipmiview/screenshot.png)</description>
